  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not rely on <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Floating_Text" target="_blank">Floating Text</a> as a storage medium; it is neither secure nor finalized.
    <ul>
      <li>Floating text has been altered in past server updates, breaking existing content; future changes may occur.</li>
      <li>Even "invisible"[[1]](#footnote_1) floating text is transmitted to the client.
      <ul>
        <li>It can be viewed by anyone with a client that is capable of rendering text that is supposed to be invisible.</li>
        <li>The network packets that contain the text can be sniffed and the text read.</li>
      </ul>
    
      </li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
  </ul>
